# Docs (Obsidian vault = `docs/`)
- Every .md has YAML frontmatter: `title`, `type` (PRD|Architecture|Database|Roadmap|Guide|Log), `status` (Draft|Active|Deprecated|Archived), `last_updated` (YYYY-MM-DD), `tags`.
- Link other docs with `[[filename]]` wiki-links (no dangling links). Register every new file under its category in `docs/INDEX.md`.
- Single source of truth: link, don't copy (`docs/CONTEXT.md` §5 says where each fact lives). Plans, roadmap and core docs must not contradict each other.
- `docs/09_Codebase/*` catalogs and `lessons_learned.md` are generated (🤖) — edit sources, then `pnpm docs:gen` → `pnpm docs:check`.
- `docs/_learning/` is a separate private repo — don't touch it unless asked.
